{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02575","headline":"从军行二首 一 · 虞世南","name":"从军行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涂山烽候惊，弭节度龙城。\n冀马楼兰将，燕犀上谷兵。\n劒寒花不落，弓晓月逾明。\n凛凛严霜节，冰壮黄河绝。\n蔽日卷征蓬，浮天散飞雪。\n全兵值月满，精骑乘胶折。\n结发早驱驰，辛苦事旌麾。\n马冻重关冷，轮摧九折危。\n独有西山将，年年属数奇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}